@startuml
title UML State Machine Diagram - User

[*] --> Register
Register : entry / nil
Register : do / register user
Register : exit / valid registration / login

Login : entry / nil
Login : do / login user
Login : exit / successful login / LoginSuccessful

LoginSuccessful : entry / login successful
LoginSuccessful : do / display options
LoginSuccessful --> CheckTicketStatus
LoginSuccessful --> BookTicket
LoginSuccessful --> ManageAccountDetails
LoginSuccessful --> Logout

CheckTicketStatus : entry / check ticket status
CheckTicketStatus : do / display ticket status
CheckTicketStatus --> [*]

BookTicket : entry / book a ticket
BookTicket : do / confirm booking and make payment
BookTicket : exit / successful booking / TicketBooked

TicketBooked : entry / ticket booked successfully
TicketBooked : do / display confirmation message
TicketBooked --> [*]

ManageAccountDetails : entry / manage account details
ManageAccountDetails : do / edit or delete account details
ManageAccountDetails --> [*]

Logout : entry / log out user
Logout : do / log out user
Logout --> [*]
@enduml
